      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُبَبَةٌ</span></b>  <i>One who reviles people;</i> (S, K;) as also

↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَسَبَّةٌ</span></b> . (K.) One says, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَا تَكُنْ سُبَبَةً وَلَا سُبَّةً</span></b> 
